Douglas-Todd-Stevens-Pope-Stearns-Lac Qui Parle-Swift-Chippewa-

Kandiyohi-Meeker-Yellow Medicine-Renville-McLeod-Sibley-Redwood-

Brown-Nicollet-Watonwan-Blue Earth-Martin-Faribault-

816 PM CDT Tue Aug 5 2025



This Hazardous Weather Outlook is for portions of central

Minnesota...south central Minnesota...southwest Minnesota and

west central Minnesota.



.DAY ONE...Tonight.



Thunderstorms will move into western Minnesota late this evening

and into parts of southern Minnesota toward dawn. A few storms

could be severe with large hail and damaging winds. Locally heavy

rain is possible as well.



.DAYS TWO THROUGH SEVEN...Wednesday through Monday.



A few rounds of strong or severe thunderstorms are possible 

Wednesday night, and Friday night through Saturday night.



.SPOTTER INFORMATION STATEMENT...



SKYWARN spotter activation may be needed overnight.



$$



